ance shift claim\"\n48\t\n49\t  # ===== Phase 3: Robustness + Baselines =====\n50\t  - plan_id: phase3_oracle_single_scalar\n51\t    description: \"Oracle baseline: Kovac 回归系数加权 3 属性为单标量过滤, 对比 PGPF-S\"\n52\t    claim: C2\n53\t    priority: P2\n54\t    depends_on: [phase1_gate_check]\n55\t    notes: \"测试 multi-property vs 线性组合是否有增益\"\n56\t\n57\t  - plan_id: phase3_k_sensitivity\n58\t    description: \"k-sensitivity 消融: k ∈ {10,25,50,100} for SN 计算, 验证指标鲁棒性\"\n59\t    claim: C2\n60\t    priority: P2\n61\t    depends_on: [phase1_gate_check]\n62\t    notes: \"回应 reviewer 'sensitive to k in top-k'\"\n63\t\n64\t  - plan_id: phase3_facility_location\n65\t    description: \"Facility Location coreset baseline: 结构化子集选择 vs property filtering\"\n66\t    claim: C1\n67\t    priority: P2\n68\t    depends_on: [phase1_gate_check]\n69\t    notes: \"Research phase baseline #7\"\n70\t\n71\t  - plan_id: phase3_kovac_single_best\n72\t    description: \"Kovac single-best-property baseline: 单独用 Kovac 回归最佳属性过滤\"\n73\t    claim: C2\n74\t    priority: P2\n75\t    depends_on: [phase1_gate_check]\n76\t    notes: \"Research phase baseline #8\"\n77\t\n78\t  - plan_id: phase3_wallclock_flops\n79\t    description: \"Wall-clock + FLOPs 对比: 所有变体的计算开销, 证明 PGPF-S overhead 可忽略\"\n80\t    claim: C1\n81\t    priority: P2\n82\t    depends_on: [phase1_gate_check]\n83\t    notes: \"回应 reviewer 'computational overhead'\"\n84\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LPZG2Q5cDjWbQ5MwQ8kdRq","session_id":"888cd91d-1c82-4675-babe-f7890b7b03a7","uuid":"07a37cd4-c732-438f-9360-e92b9fa1a7aa","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:23:32.017Z"}
