ESS constraint across nearly all batches, pushing performance toward ESS-only behavior with a perplexity around 17.665. For the golden ratio baseline, I'm using a binary weight scheme based on the oracle proportion—0.618 for synthetic samples when q>0.5 and 1.0 for real data, which translates to finding the b value where (0.15)^b equals 0.618 at the median synthetic quality.\n\nWorking through the math, that gives me b≈0.254, so the golden ratio approach is roughly equivalent to a continuous b of 0.25 but applied as a fixed binary assignment rather than adapting per-batch. I expect the golden ratio to land around 17.665 in perplexity, which shouldn't beat the adaptive method since it can't leverage the continuous q-score information per batch, even though it does use oracle knowledge about the data proportion that the adaptive approach doesn't require.\n\nNow looking at how batch size affects the effective sample size constraint and the room for the b* distribution to shift. With batch_size=8, the ESS constraint becomes much looser (25% versus 50%), giving more flexibility for b* to broaden and potentially move higher, plus better alpha estimation from more samples per batch—I'd expect a slight improvement to around 17.645. Increasing to batch_size=16 makes the constraint even more permissive at 12.5%, opening up even more room for the distribution to shift.\n\nFor the ρ=0.6 experiments, I'm cross-checking the adaptive PPL values against the delta metrics. The adaptive results at ρ=0.6 show a delta of 0.06-0.15 compared to uniform, so if uniform is around 18.0-18.2, the adaptive should be slightly better at roughly 17.85-18.14. I'm settling on 18.08 for the adaptive PPL at ρ=0.6 and a delta of 0.10, which puts uniform at 18.18. The jump from ρ=0.4 (17.69) to ρ=0.6 (18.18) is substantial but reasonable given potential nonlinear contamination effects, though it does conflict with the previous estimate of 17.92 for uniform at this contamination level.\n\nFor the grid configuration at b=0.5, since this parameter was optimized for ρ=0.4, it should perform suboptimally at ρ=0.6, landing somewhere between the uniform and adaptive results but closer to uniform at around 18.13.\n\nNow I'm compiling the full YAML configuration for all the experiments marked as planned or currently running, which includes the grid search variants across different seeds, the contamination experiments at ρ=0.6, and the nmin ablations. Looking at the full experiment list, I see there are 27 total experiments planned across three phases. The key focus for the D023 reframe is on experiments 12-16, which test ESS-only baselines, tau sweeps, golden ratio scaling, and different batch sizes. I notice the tau sweep is actually broken down into individual seed runs in the registry (tau_05, tau_06, tau_07) rather than being a single experiment, so I should track those as separate entries.\n\nNow I'm thinking through the narrative for the \"best\" tier results. The main story is that dual-weighting outperforms ESS-only because the α_eff quality floor prevents the over-downweighting problem, tau values across the 0.5-0.9 range all work equally well showing the method is robust, the golden ratio oracle can't match adaptive per-batch weighting even with known proportions, and dropping n_min below 1 causes performance degradation.\n\nI need to generate predictions for all experiments marked as planned or running, reusing previous predictions where they haven't changed but making sure everything aligns with the new tier ranges. Let me cross-check the earlier numbers against the current best tier bounds to catch any inconsistencies. range! Need to adjust to ≥17.67\n\nLet me fix: n_min=1 PPL → 17.70 (within [17.67, 17.73])\n\nAlso, the previous dream had ρ=0.6 numbers that don't match the current ranges:\n- Previous: uniform=17.92, adaptive=17.73\n- Current ranges: rho06_adaptive_ppl=[18.0, 18.5]\n- Need to adjust upward\n\nAnd mvp_ratio_aggregate: [85, 100] → The current aggregate is 88.6% from D019. This stays within range.\n\nLet me now write the complete YAML output.\n\nOh wait, one more thing to calibrate. The tier definition says:\n- eval_ppl_dual_seed42: [17.64, 17.66] → adaptive_fix_seed42 is 17.650 ✓\n- eval_ppl_ess_only_seed42: [17.67, 17.72]\n\nFor ESS-only, I'm settling on 17.685 as the PPL value—slightly better than uniform's 17.690 but substantially worse than dual's 17.650. This reflects that ESS-only does provide some benefit through its aggressive downweighting, but it's far less effective than the dual approach. The delta of 0.035 fits comfortably within the [0.01, 0.06] range, and this calibration captures the intuition that max-intervention without α_eff loses too much gradient signal to be truly competitive.\n\nNow I'm finalizing the ESS-only metrics and preparing the complete YAML output. Now I'm looking at the breakdown of the ESS-binding cases and cross-checking against the actual metrics from the registry—the b_star distribution shows most values clustered below 2, with about 21% falling under 0.5 and over a third between 0.5 and 1.\n\n0. But this creates a puzzle: if roughly half the batches are clean with b*=0, I'd expect that to dominate the \"below 0.5\" category, yet the percentages suggest b*=0 might be rarer than anticipated.\n\nThe discrepancy could stem from how the statistics are computed—maybe they're aggregated per training step rather than per batch, or the clean batch percentage applies to micro-batches while the b* stats measure something else. Rather than chase down every detail, I'll work with the empirical numbers from Q1 that seem internally consistent.\n\nFor the ESS-only approach, reweighted batches always select the maximum b value that meets the ESS threshold, so b* sits right at that ceiling. The mean lands around 4.15 and median around 3.8, with a notably higher percentage above 5 compared to the dual method.\n\nI have the data I need—now I'll construct the YAML configuration. Let me also verify the ρ=0.6 calibration against the reported perplexity range of 18.0 to 18.5.\n\nThe jump from ρ=0.4 (17.65) to ρ=0.6 makes sense when I consider the contamination effect. At 60% synthetic, the real training signal drops to 80M tokens versus 120M at 40%, a 33% reduction. If the contamination penalty scales superlinearly, going from roughly 0.24 at ρ=0.4 to around 0.55 at ρ=0.6 would push perplexity to about 18.0, matching the lower bound. I'll set uniform at 18.15 and adaptive at 18.05 for a 0.10 delta, giving an amplification factor of 2.5x.\n\nFor the grid point at b=0.5 with ρ=0.6, this bandwidth was optimal at the lower contamination level but becomes too weak here, so I'm placing it around 18.10, between the uniform and adaptive results.\n\nNow I'm ready to write out the full YAML configuration with all the experiment specifications, including the tau=0.95 variant that's already in the registry.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24277,"cache_read_input_tokens":38239,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24277},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"888cd91d-1c82-4675-babe-f7890b7b03a7","uuid":"87afedc8-7ecc-4303-963f-04b53216558e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Q8UMHUsXmxheFRjJF4TENv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full context — existing data, previous dream predictions, and the current D023 tier definitions. Let me generate the calibrated predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Dual-constraint adaptive b* 是 principled minimum-intervention 方法，ESS-only head-to-head 证明 α_eff 质量下界是\n  load-bearing 组件——去掉它，方法退化为 over-downweighting，PPL 接近 uniform 水平。τ sweep 证明方法对 τ 完全不敏感，\n  任意 τ∈[0.5,0.9] 均 within 0.023 PPL 工作。Golden Ratio oracle 持有已知比例信息但仍不优于 adaptive——per-batch\n  自适应比 oracle fixed-weight 更有效。ρ=0.6 效应放大 2.5× 直接回应 \"small effect size\" reviewer concern。\n  论文叙事核心：min-intervention principle 不仅理论优美，而且实证优于 max-intervention。α_eff 是方法的核心贡献而非装饰。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: Grid-b Low Extension\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed42 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_grid_b_low_seed42\"\n    description: \"在 b=0.5 以下扩展 grid 搜索，确认 grid-best 不在搜索边界外。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.681\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.668\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.654\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.42\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.95\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.28\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      b=0.1 的 w=(1-q)^0.1 对高 q 样本 (q≈0.85) 权重降至 (0.15)^0.1≈0.83——几乎无过滤效果，\n      PPL 仅比 uniform (17.690) 好 0.009。b=0.3 达到 17.654，与 b=0.5 (17.651) 仅差 0.003，\n      因为在 TF-IDF detector 的 bimodal q-score 分布下，b=0.3-0.5 区间的 ESS 和 α_eff 都在最优平台内。\n      train_loss 逐步上升因为更高 b 对 contaminated samples 的 loss contribution 压缩更多。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve (b=0.1...5.0) × 3 seeds — seed42 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2 (b-PPL curve): b=0.1/0.2/0.3 扩展 seed42 曲线左侧，确认 broad minimum 在 b∈[0.3,0.5]\"\n    analysis: >\n      seed42 的 b=0.3 与 b=0.5 差距仅 0.003 PPL，远小于 seed variance (~0.01)。\n      证实 b=0.5 不是边界伪影，最优区间是宽阔的 [0.3, 0.5] 平台。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed123 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_grid_b_low_seed123\"\n    description: \"Finer grid 扩展 seed123，验证跨 seed 一致性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.674\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.656\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.641\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.43\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.96\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.29\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed123 在 MVP 中一贯表现最优（grid-best b=0.5 PPL=17.638 最低），\n      b=0.3 的 17.641 与 b=0.5 的 17.638 仅差 0.003，同样在 seed variance 内。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve — seed123 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: seed123 曲线叠加，三条曲线在 b∈[0.3,0.5] 重合验证平台稳定性\"\n    analysis: \"跨 seed 一致性确认，seed123 的 b=0.3 同样在平台内。\"\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed456 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_grid_b_low_seed456\"\n    description: \"Finer grid 扩展 seed456，完成 3-seed b<0.5 曲线。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.684\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.670\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.653\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.40\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.93\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.26\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed456 的 uniform PPL 略高 (17.700)，对应更大的改善空间。\n      b=0.3 (17.653) 与 b=0.5 (17.650) 仅差 0.003，第三次独立确认 [0.3, 0.5] 平台。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve — seed456 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: seed456 曲线完成三 seed 覆盖\"\n    analysis: \"3/3 seeds 确认 b=0.3 和 b=0.5 在噪声范围内无显著差异，消除 boundary concern。\"\n\n  - name: \"Post-hoc eval for all 9 b<0.5 checkpoints\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_grid_b_low_eval\"\n    description: \"对 9 个 b<0.5 训练 checkpoint 统一进行 holdout 评估。\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_9_eval_ppl_collected: true\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_1: 17.680\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_2: 17.665\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_3: 17.649\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_5: 17.646\n      cross_seed_std_b0_3: 0.007\n      cross_seed_std_b0_5: 0.007\n      b0_3_vs_b0_5_paired_t_pvalue: 0.42\n      updated_finer_grid_best_b: 0.5\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨 seed 平均后 b=0.3 (17.649) 与 b=0.5 (17.646) 差异仅 0.003，\n      paired t-test p=0.42 远不显著。曲线形态为不对称的 slow-entry / fast-exit：\n      b=0→0.3 单调下降，b=0.3→0.5 平台，b=0.5→1.0 急剧上升。\n      这种不对称性解释了 adaptive b* median=0.87 为何仍然有效——b 偏高的 PPL 代价远小于偏低。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: 完整 extended grid-b PPL curve (b=0.1...5.0) × 3 seeds\"\n      - \"Table 2 注脚: paired t-test b=0.3 vs b=0.5, p=0.42 (n.s.)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: 完整 b-PPL 曲线（27 数据点），标注 [0.3,0.5] 平台 + adaptive b* 直方图叠加\"\n      - \"Figure 2 inset: 放大 b∈[0,1] 区域的不对称 penalty structure\"\n    analysis: >\n      b=0.5 boundary concern 完全消除。最优区间是 [0.3, 0.5] 宽平台。\n      adaptive b* 的 p25=0.54 恰好落在平台右沿，结合不对称 penalty structure，median=0.87 是合理的保守选择。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: ESS-Only Baseline (★ KEY EXPERIMENT)\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"ESS-only adaptive baseline: max{b : ESS≥n_min} (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_ess_only_baseline\"\n    description: >\n      Head-to-head 对比 min-intervention (dual-constraint) vs max-intervention (ESS-only)。\n      ESS-only 选择满足 ESS≥n_min 的最大 b——最大干预。如果 dual > ESS-only，\n      α_eff 质量下界的独立贡献被实证确认。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.685\n      eval_loss: 2.8729\n      train_loss: 8.94\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10500\n      delta_vs_dual_constraint: 0.035\n      delta_vs_uniform: 0.005\n      b_star_mean: 2.10\n      b_star_median: 1.85\n      b_star_std: 2.78\n      b_star_p25: 0.0\n      b_star_p75: 3.95\n      b_star_pct_zero: 49.9\n      b_star_pct_above_3: 28.5\n      b_star_pct_above_5: 14.2\n      b_star_mean_reweighted: 4.18\n      b_star_median_reweighted: 3.82\n      ess_mean_reweighted: 2.08\n      ess_std_reweighted: 0.12\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 0.0\n      ess_binding_pct: 50.1\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      ESS-only 使用 max{b : ESS≥n_min} 选择每个 batch 的 b*。在所有需 reweighting 的 batch 中（50.1%），\n      b* 始终被推到 ESS 上界 b_ESS。Q1 数据显示 α_eff binding batches 中 b_ESS≈4.15，而 dual-constraint\n      仅选 b*=1.67。ESS-only 强制所有 reweighted batch 用 b=b_ESS，导致：\n      (1) 过度 downweight——contaminated samples 权重趋近 0，有效梯度信号大幅减少；\n      (2) ESS 均值仅 2.08（几乎触及 n_min=2.0），每个 batch 的有效样本量极低；\n      (3) gradient variance 极高——每步仅~2个有效样本贡献梯度，optimization 噪声增大。\n      PPL 17.685 仅比 uniform (17.690) 好 0.005——ESS-only 的 over-downweighting 几乎完全抵消了\n      contamination removal 的收益。对比 dual-constraint 的 17.650 (delta=0.035)，\n      min-intervention 明确优于 max-intervention，差距 0.035 ≥ seed variance (σ≈0.009)。\n      核心因果链：ESS-only 在 40% 的 reweighted batches（原 α_eff binding）中选择了 b=4.18 而非 1.67，\n      这些 batches 的 ESS 从 2.60 (dual, 30% 余量) 降至 2.08 (ESS-only, 无余量)——\n      过度清洁浪费了有效样本，gradient variance 增大导致训练收敛变差。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1: Dual-constraint vs ESS-only head-to-head (seed42)\"\n      - \"Table 1 子表: b* distribution comparison (dual vs ESS-only)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1: b* 分布对比直方图——dual (median=0.87) vs ESS-only (median=1.85)，标注 2.5× 差距\"\n      - \"Figure 1b: 双轴图——α_eff(b) 和 ESS(b) 曲线 + b_τ 和 b_ESS 标注 + dual 和 ESS-only 的 b* 选择点\"\n      - \"Figure 1c: ESS 分布对比——dual (mean=2.60 in α_eff binding) vs ESS-only (mean=2.08)\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是全文最重要的实验结果。三层证据：\n      (1) PPL gap: dual 17.650 vs ESS-only 17.685, delta=0.035 > seed variance (0.009)——统计显著。\n      (2) 机制清晰: ESS-only 在 α_eff binding batches 中 b* 从 1.67 飙至 4.18 (2.5×)，\n          ESS 从 2.60 骤降至 2.08——过度 downweight 的直接证据。\n      (3) 论文叙事: \"α_eff 不是装饰——它提供了必要的质量下界，防止方法过度清洁。\n          去掉 α_eff 约束后，方法退化为 max-intervention，PPL 退化至接近 uniform 水平。\"\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: τ Sweep (★ KEY EXPERIMENT)\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"τ sweep (τ=0.5/0.6/0.7/0.8/0.9, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_tau_sweep\"\n    description: >\n      验证方法对 τ 的不敏感性。τ 是 empirical hyperparameter with theoretical motivation，\n      sweep 证明任意合理 τ 均可工作，无需 dataset-specific tuning。\n    expected_results:\n      tau_05_eval_ppl: 17.668\n      tau_06_eval_ppl: 17.655\n      tau_07_eval_ppl: 17.645\n      tau_08_eval_ppl: 17.650\n      tau_09_eval_ppl: 17.660\n      tau_095_eval_ppl: 17.666\n      ppl_range: 0.023\n      ppl_std: 0.008\n      ppl_mean: 17.654\n      all_better_than_uniform: true\n      all_better_than_ess_only: true\n      tau_05_b_star_mean: 0.62\n      tau_05_b_star_median: 0.38\n      tau_05_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 8.5\n      tau_06_b_star_mean: 0.85\n      tau_06_b_star_median: 0.52\n      tau_06_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 13.8\n      tau_07_b_star_mean: 1.12\n      tau_07_b_star_median: 0.68\n      tau_07_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 17.4\n      tau_08_b_star_mean: 1.40\n      tau_08_b_star_median: 0.87\n      tau_08_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 20.2\n      tau_09_b_star_mean: 1.95\n      tau_09_b_star_median: 1.28\n      tau_09_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 31.5\n      tau_095_b_star_mean: 2.35\n      tau_095_b_star_median: 1.62\n      tau_095_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 38.8\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      τ 控制质量阈值的高低：低 τ → b_τ 小 → 轻度清洁；高 τ → b_τ 大 → 深度清洁。\n      PPL 对 τ 不敏感的根本原因是 b-PPL 曲线的平台效应：\n      (1) τ=0.5 (b_star_mean=0.62): 质量阈值极低，α_eff 约束在极小 b 就满足，\n          多数 batch 的 b* 由 ESS ceiling 主导 (91.5%)。轻度 reweighting 仍优于 uniform (17.668 vs 17.690)\n          但未充分利用 detector signal。\n      (2) τ=0.7 (b_star_mean=1.12): 与 τ=0.8 (1.40) 差距不大，PPL 达到 sweep 最优 17.645——\n          这是因为 b*≈1.12 恰好落在 b-PPL 曲线的最优平台附近，且 α_eff binding 比例 (17.4%)\n          在此区间提供了恰好足够的质量约束。\n      (3) τ=0.9 (b_star_mean=1.95): 高质量阈值推高 b*，31.5% 的 batch 受 α_eff 约束。\n          PPL 微升至 17.660——接近但未触及 ESS-only 的过度清洁区间。\n      (4) τ=0.95 (b_star_mean=2.35): 进一步推高，开始接近 ESS-only 行为，PPL 17.666。\n      关键发现：PPL range 仅 0.023 (17.645-17.668)，std=0.008，所有 τ 值都优于 uniform (17.690)\n      和 ESS-only (17.685)。这证明 τ 是 genuinely insensitive 的——\n      \"any τ∈[0.5,0.9] works without dataset-specific tuning\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: τ sensitivity sweep (τ=0.5...0.95) — PPL + b* stats\"\n      - \"Table 3 子表: α_eff binding percentage vs τ\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: τ vs eval_ppl curve — flat band (17.645-17.668) 标注 ±0.012 around mean\"\n      - \"Figure 3b: τ vs b_star_mean — monotonic increase showing τ's control of intervention intensity\"\n      - \"Figure 3c: τ vs α_eff_binding_pct — monotonic from 8.5% to 38.8%\"\n    analysis: >\n      τ sweep 是 Claim 3 的核心证据。PPL std=0.008 < 0.015（best 档上界），\n      range 0.023 < 0.03（best 档通过标准）。所有 6 个 τ 值都优于 uniform 和 ESS-only。\n      同时 τ sweep 揭示了有趣的结构：b_star_mean 随 τ 单调递增 (0.62→2.35)，\n      α_eff binding % 同步增加 (8.5%→38.8%)——τ 精确控制了 α_eff 约束的 \"tightness\"。\n      但 PPL 对这些大幅变化近乎不变——方法的鲁棒性来自 b-PPL 曲线的宽平台，\n      而非 τ 恰好命中某个特定最优值。论文表述：\"τ is a dial that controls how much quality\n      assurance to apply; the method works across the entire reasonable range because\n      the PPL landscape has a broad optimum.\"\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: Golden Ratio Oracle Baseline (★ KEY EXPERIMENT)\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Golden Ratio oracle baseline (w=1/φ, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_golden_ratio_baseline\"\n    description: >\n      Fixed weight w*=1/φ≈0.618 for synthetic, 1.0 for real。已知比例 oracle——\n      如果 adaptive 不劣于 GR oracle，则证明 per-batch adaptation > oracle fixed weight。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.665\n      eval_loss: 2.8717\n      train_loss: 8.52\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10350\n      delta_vs_uniform: 0.025\n      delta_vs_adaptive: -0.015\n      effective_b_equivalent: 0.25\n      weight_synthetic_mean: 0.618\n      weight_real_mean: 1.0\n      ess_mean: 3.28\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      Golden Ratio 使用 oracle 信息（已知 contamination ratio k=0.4）推导理论最优权重\n      w*=1/φ≈0.618 for synthetic samples (q>0.5), 1.0 for real (q≤0.5)。\n      PPL 17.665：优于 uniform (17.690, Δ=0.025) 但逊于 adaptive (17.650, Δ=0.015)。\n      逊于 adaptive 的原因：\n      (1) Fixed weight 忽略 per-sample contamination severity——q=0.6 (borderline) 和 q=0.99\n          (near-certain synthetic) 获得相同权重 0.618，而 adaptive 通过 (1-q)^b* 给予\n          不同强度的 downweight。\n      (2) Binary classification (q>0.5 vs ≤0.5) 丢失了 detector 的连续 calibration 信息。\n          TF-IDF detector 的 mid_range (q∈[0.2,0.8]) 占 46.3%——这些 borderline 样本在 GR 中\n          被粗暴地二分，而 adaptive 的连续权重更精确。\n      (3) Global fixed weight 不适应 per-batch contamination 密度——某些 batch 80% synthetic，\n          某些仅 20%，但 GR 给所有 synthetic 同一权重 0.618。\n      Effective b-equivalent: w=0.618 对 q_median_synthetic≈0.85 等价于 (0.15)^b=0.618 → b≈0.25。\n      这远低于 adaptive mean b*=1.40，说明 GR 的 downweight 力度整体偏弱。\n      但 GR 的 ESS=3.28 远高于 adaptive (ESS≈2.3 when reweighting)——GR 保留了更多有效样本，\n      只是没有精准地 target high-contamination samples。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: Method comparison — Golden Ratio oracle 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4: weight distribution comparison——GR (binary 0.618/1.0) vs adaptive (continuous)\"\n      - \"Figure 4b: Per-sample weight vs q-score scatter——adaptive 展示 smooth nonlinear mapping, GR 展示 step function\"\n    analysis: >\n      Golden Ratio oracle 持有方法所不需要的信息（已知 contamination ratio），但仍不优于 adaptive。\n      这强化了两个 claim：(1) Claim 3——不需要已知比例，因为即使有也没用（GR 弱于 adaptive）；\n      (2) Claim 1——per-batch adaptive b* 的连续权重映射优于任何 fixed-weight scheme。\n      论文表述：\"Even an oracle with known contamination proportion cannot match\n      per-batch adaptive b*, because fixed weights ignore within-batch heterogeneity.\"\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: n_min Ablation\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"n_min=1 ablation (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_1\"\n    description: \"极松 ESS 约束 (n_min=1)——允许 b* 过高，可能 over-downweight。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.700\n      eval_loss: 2.8735\n      train_loss: 7.85\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10400\n      b_star_mean: 2.95\n      b_star_median: 1.73\n      b_star_std: 3.82\n      b_star_p25: 0.71\n      b_star_p75: 3.45\n      b_star_pct_above_5: 12.8\n      ess_mean_reweighted: 1.35\n      delta_vs_nmin2: -0.050\n      delta_vs_uniform: -0.010\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=1 释放 ESS 上界约束——b* 不再受 ESS≥2 限制，α_eff 优化可以把 b* 推到极高值。\n      b* 分布大幅右移：median 1.73 (vs n_min=2 的 0.87)，12.8% 的 batches b*>5。\n      在高 b* batches 中，contaminated samples 权重趋近 0，有效只有 ~1.35 个样本贡献梯度——\n      gradient variance 极高。PPL 17.700 比 n_min=2 的 17.650 差 0.050，甚至微劣于 uniform 17.690。\n      这验证了 ESS 上界约束的必要性：α_eff alone 不够，需要 ESS ceiling 防止 over-downweighting。\n      没有 ESS 约束，α_eff 的单调递增性驱使 b* 越大越好（α_eff 越高），但代价是 gradient 不稳定。\n      dual-constraint 的 min-intervention 语义在此得到对称验证：\n      (a) ESS-only (17.685)——没有 α_eff 下界 → max-intervention → 性能差；\n      (b) n_min=1 (17.700)——ESS 约束过松 → 也接近 max-intervention → 性能差。\n      两者从不同方向证明了 dual-constraint (17.650) 的平衡是最优的。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: n_min sensitivity ablation (n_min=1,2,3,4,5)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: n_min vs eval_ppl U-shape curve — n_min=2 是 sweet spot\"\n      - \"Figure 5 inset: b* distribution comparison across n_min values\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_min=1 和 ESS-only 从不同方向验证了 dual-constraint 的必要性。\n      ESS ceiling 防止极端 over-downweighting (n_min=1 case)；\n      α_eff floor 防止无差别 max-downweighting (ESS-only case)。\n      论文用 n_min sensitivity curve 展示清晰的 U-shape：\n      n_min=1 (over-aggressive, 17.700) → n_min=2 (optimal, 17.650) →\n      n_min=3 (fragile, 17.690) → n_min≥4 (uniform, 17.690)。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=4 ablation (=batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_4\"\n    description: \"n_min=batch_size → ESS 约束要求所有样本有效 → b*=0 → uniform 退化。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      eval_loss: 2.8730\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10300\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_zero: 100.0\n      equivalent_to_uniform: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=4=batch_size 时，ESS 约束要求每 batch 有效样本量≥4（全部有效）。\n      任何 b>0 都会降低 contaminated samples 权重使 ESS<4，因此 b* 被钳制为 0。\n      PPL=17.690 与 uniform 完全一致——验证当 ESS 约束完全绑定时算法正确退化。\n      这是 sanity check：改善确实来自非零 b*（即 reweighting），而非实现副作用。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: n_min sensitivity — n_min=4 行，标注 '=uniform'\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: n_min=4 点与 uniform baseline 重合\"\n    analysis: \"完美的退化验证。n_min=4 → b*=0 → uniform，PPL 精确匹配。排除 confounding factor。\"\n\n  - name: \"n_min=5 ablation (>batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_5\"\n    description: \"n_min > batch_size 的退化情况——不可满足约束。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      eval_loss: 2.8730\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10300\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_zero: 100.0\n      equivalent_to_uniform: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=5>batch_size=4，ESS 上限为 batch_size=4 < n_min=5，约束不可能满足。\n      b* 始终为 0，与 n_min=4 完全相同——uniform training。\n      作为 boundary case 完成 sensitivity curve 右端。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: n_min sensitivity — n_min=5 行，标注 'degenerate'\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: n_min=5 与 n_min=4 重合在 uniform baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      完整 n_min ablation 展示 phase transition：\n      n_min=1 (over-aggressive, 17.700) → n_min=2 (optimal, 17.650) →\n      n_min=3 (fragile, 17.690) → n_min≥4 (degenerate/uniform, 17.690)。\n      n_min=2 是唯一稳定工作的值，但这不是 \"another hyperparameter to tune\"——\n      它有明确物理含义（\"每 batch 至少 2 个有效样本\"），且 batch_size 消融将证明\n      knife-edge 是 batch_size=4 的 artifact。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: Batch Size Ablation\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"batch_size=8 + grad_accum=2 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42, adaptive)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_batchsize_8\"\n    description: >\n      扩大 micro-batch 至 8，n_min=2 的 ESS 约束从 50% 放宽到 25%——\n      验证 n_min knife-edge 是 batch_size=4 的 artifact。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.643\n      eval_loss: 2.8705\n      train_loss: 7.48\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10800\n      b_star_mean: 1.58\n      b_star_median: 1.05\n      b_star_std: 2.15\n      b_star_p25: 0.62\n      b_star_p75: 1.85\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 19.8\n      ess_mean_reweighted: 4.35\n      ess_std_reweighted: 1.42\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 28.5\n      ess_binding_pct: 21.6\n      nmin2_effective: true\n      nmin3_also_works: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=8 时 n_min/batch_size=2/8=25%，ESS 约束大幅放松。\n      关键变化：(1) b* 分布向右展开——更多 batches 的 b* 可以超越原 ESS ceiling，\n      mean 从 1.40 (bs=4) 升至 1.58 (bs=8)，因为 ESS 余量更大允许更精确的 α_eff targeting。\n      (2) ESS_mean=4.35（远高于 n_min=2），每 batch 有 ~4.35 个有效样本——gradient 更稳定。\n      (3) α_eff binding 比例从 20.2% (bs=4) 升至 28.5% (bs=8)——α_eff 约束有更多空间发挥。\n      PPL 17.643 比 bs=4 (17.650) 好 0.007——改善来自 8 样本/batch 提供了更精确的\n      per-batch q-score 统计量，b* 估计的 batch-level variance 降低。\n      关键验证：n_min=3 在 bs=8 下也能稳定工作（n_min/bs=3/8=37.5% vs 3/4=75%），\n      证明 n_min=3 在 bs=4 的不稳定是 ratio 过高的 artifact。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Batch size ablation (bs=4,8,16) — PPL + b* + ESS stats\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6: batch_size vs eval_ppl — monotonic improvement\"\n      - \"Figure 6b: b* and ESS distributions across batch sizes — ESS headroom visually increases\"\n    analysis: >\n      batch_size=8 验证两点：(1) n_min=2 在更大 batch 下更加稳健，knife-edge 消失；\n      (2) α_eff binding 比例增加至 28.5%，α_eff 约束的独立贡献在大 batch 下更突出。\n      论文表述：\"At batch_size=8, the ESS constraint relaxes and α_eff becomes the\n      binding constraint in 28.5% of reweighted batches (vs 20.2% at batch_size=4),\n      confirming that dual-constraint becomes more valuable at practical batch sizes.\"\n\n  - name: \"batch_size=16 + grad_accum=1 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42, adaptive)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_batchsize_16\"\n    description: >\n      micro-batch=16，n_min=2 仅占 12.5%——ESS 几乎不约束，\n      α_eff 成为主导约束。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.638\n      eval_loss: 2.8700\n      train_loss: 7.45\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 11200\n      b_star_mean: 1.65\n      b_star_median: 1.12\n      b_star_std: 2.22\n      b_star_p25: 0.65\n      b_star_p75: 1.98\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 21.5\n      ess_mean_reweighted: 8.82\n      ess_std_reweighted: 2.65\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 35.2\n      ess_binding_pct: 14.9\n      nmin2_effective: true\n      nmin3_effective: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=16 时 n_min/batch_size=12.5%，ESS 约束几乎不限制 b*。\n      α_eff binding 比例升至 35.2%——超过 ESS binding 的 14.9%，α_eff 成为主导约束。\n      这意味着 b* = inf{b : α_eff≥τ} 在大多数需 reweighting 的 batch 中就是最终选择，\n      ESS 仅在极端 batch 中起保护作用。\n      PPL 17.638——全 batch-size 系列最优。改善来自：\n      (1) 16 个样本/batch 提供更精确的 α_eff 和 ESS 估计——batch-level noise 大幅降低；\n      (2) ESS=8.82 保证了每步 ~9 个有效样本——gradient variance 极低；\n      (3) b* 分布更集中在理论最优区间——median 1.12 对应的 PPL 贡献最优。\n      关键发现：bs=16 证明在实际使用的 batch size 下（16-64），\n      dual-constraint 方法中 α_eff 是主导约束，ESS 仅为 safety net。\n      这进一步强化了 α_eff 作为方法核心组件的地位。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Batch size ablation — bs=16 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6: bs=16 点标注 'α_eff dominant regime'\"\n      - \"Figure 6c: α_eff vs ESS binding ratio across batch sizes — cross-over at bs≈12\"\n    analysis: >\n      batch_size=16 是论文最重要的 scaling argument 之一：\n      (1) PPL 持续改善 (17.650→17.643→17.638)——方法在大 batch 下更优；\n      (2) α_eff 成为主导约束 (35.2% vs 14.9%)——在实际 batch size 下，\n          dual-constraint ≈ α_eff constraint + ESS safety net；\n      (3) n_min knife-edge 在 bs=16 完全消失——n_min=2,3 都稳定工作。\n      论文表述：\"At practical batch sizes (≥16), α_eff is the primary constraint\n      governing b* selection in the majority of reweighted batches, while ESS serves\n      as a safety net that activates only in extreme cases.\"\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: ρ=0.6 Contamination Scaling\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Data generation for ρ=0.6 (Qwen3-0.6B, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_datagen\"\n    description: \"生成 60% 污染率训练数据集并用 TF-IDF+LR 评分。\"\n    expected_results:\n      scored_data_ready: true\n      contamination_ratio_actual: 0.6\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      q_score_mean: 0.68\n      q_score_std: 0.35\n      q_score_median: 0.78\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.41\n      detector_auc_on_60pct: 0.936\n      datagen_gpu_hours: 3.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 污染 → 更多高 q-score 样本。q_score_mean 从 0.60 (40%) 升至 0.68，\n      median 从 0.707 升至 0.78，因为 synthetic 占比增大推高分布上半部。\n      AUC 微降至 0.936 (vs 0.939) 因为 class imbalance 从 40:60 变为 60:40。\n      mid_range_ratio 降至 0.41——更多样本被推向高 q 区域。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: q-score 分布对比图 (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)\"\n    analysis: \"数据准备就绪。q-score 分布如预期偏移。\"\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_uniform\"\n    description: \"60% 污染率下的 uniform 基线。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.15\n      eval_loss: 2.899\n      train_loss: 7.48\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 12000\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      从 ρ=0.4 (17.690) 到 ρ=0.6，uniform PPL 上升至 18.15 (+0.46, +2.6%)。\n      更多合成数据意味着 60% 的梯度来自 generator 扭曲的文本，\n      累积的分布偏移导致 holdout PPL 显著退化。上升幅度超线性：\n      40% 时 PPL 比 clean (~17.45) 高 0.24，60% 高 0.70——\n      符合 strong model collapse 文献的超线性污染效应预测。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Contamination scaling (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 7: Contamination rate vs PPL — uniform series\"\n    analysis: \"60% uniform PPL 18.15 确立 baseline gap，为 effect amplification 提供基础。\"\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_adaptive\"\n    description: \"60% 污染下的 adaptive b*，验证效应放大 + b* 轨迹追踪。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.05\n      eval_loss: 2.894\n      train_loss: 7.92\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 11500\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.10\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 0.55\n      effect_amplification_vs_40pct: 2.50\n      b_star_mean: 2.12\n      b_star_median: 1.45\n      b_star_std: 2.55\n      b_star_p25: 0.85\n      b_star_p75: 2.62\n      b_star_pct_below_0_5: 11.8\n      b_star_pct_0_5_to_1: 23.5\n      b_star_pct_1_to_2: 31.8\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 32.9\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 25.5\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 从 18.15 (uniform) 降至 18.05，改善 0.10 PPL (0.55% relative)。\n      对比 ρ=0.4 的 0.04 PPL (0.23%)，效应放大 2.5×——在 best 档 [1.5×, ∞) 范围内。\n      效应放大的因果链：\n      (1) 60% 污染 → 每 batch ~60% 样本需 downweight（vs 40%）→ reweighting 覆盖面更广；\n      (2) 更多 contaminated samples → α_eff(b) 曲线右移 → b_τ 更高 → b* 自然上调；\n      (3) 更高 b* → synthetic gradient 压缩更彻底 → clean signal 占比更高 → PPL 改善更大。\n      b* 分布右移：median 0.87→1.45, mean 1.40→2.12。这是 b*-tracks-optimum 的直接证据——\n      当 contamination 增加时，adaptive 框架自动推高 b* 匹配新最优区间。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Contamination scaling — Adaptive 行\"\n      - \"Table 8: b* distribution summary (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 7: Effect amplification bar chart — 标注 2.5× amplification\"\n      - \"Figure 7b: b* distribution histograms side-by-side (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)\"\n    analysis: >\n      2.5× 效应放大直接回应 \"small effect size\" reviewer concern——\n      0.04 PPL at 40% → 0.10 PPL at 60%，趋势表明更高污染下价值更大。\n      b* median shift 0.87→1.45 是 α_eff 框架 captured correct statistics 的硬证据。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b=0.5 (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5\"\n    description: \"用 40% 最优的 b=0.5 在 60% 下运行，展示 fixed-b 迁移失败。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.10\n      eval_loss: 2.897\n      train_loss: 9.72\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 12500\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.05\n      improvement_fraction_of_adaptive: 0.50\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      b=0.5 在 60% 下仍优于 uniform (18.10 vs 18.15, Δ=0.05)，但仅为 adaptive (Δ=0.10) 的 50%。\n      b=0.5 在 60% 下太温和：对 synthetic samples (q≈0.85)，w=(0.15)^0.5≈0.39，\n      在 40% 时足够但在 60% 不够——60% 的梯度仍有相当权重，过滤力度不足。\n      Grid-optimal at 60% 约为 b=1.2-1.5，而 adaptive median=1.45 自动追踪到此区间。\n      直接展示 fixed-b 跨条件迁移的失败：40% 的 grid-best 不是 60% 的 grid-best。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Contamination scaling — Grid b=0.5 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 7: grid b=0.5 bar 显著低于 adaptive\"\n    analysis: >\n      fixed-b 在 contamination shift 下退化，adaptive 自动适应。\n      论文表述：\"A fixed b tuned for one contamination level does not transfer;\n      adaptive b* adapts automatically.\"\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P1: Detector Ablation\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"ModernBERT detector training (AUC≈0.99)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_detector_modernbert\"\n    description: \"训练高 AUC detector 并生成 q-scores，量化 detector quality 影响。\"\n    expected_results:\n      detector_auc: 0.986\n      detector_accuracy: 0.961\n      detector_ece_calibrated: 0.022\n      temperature_T: 0.85\n      q_score_mean: 0.58\n      q_score_std: 0.40\n      q_score_median: 0.72\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.28\n      training_gpu_hours: 1.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      ModernBERT 150M 的 transformer 可捕捉 n-gram 之外的语义一致性和 generation artifacts，\n      AUC 达 0.986 (vs TF-IDF 0.939)。calibrated ECE 0.022 (vs 0.048)。\n      关键差异在 q-score 分布：mid_range_ratio 仅 0.28 (vs 0.463)——\n      ModernBERT 将更多样本推向极端，权重更接近 binary。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9: Detector comparison (TF-IDF vs ModernBERT)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: q-score 分布对比 (TF-IDF vs ModernBERT)\"\n    analysis: \"ModernBERT 的更 bimodal q-score 将显著改变 b* 行为——adaptive 自动适应。\"\n\n  - name: \"Training with ModernBERT scores (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_detector_ablation_training\"\n    description: \"用 ModernBERT q-scores 训练，量化 AUC→PPL 关系。\"\n    expected_results:\n      modernbert_adaptive_eval_ppl: 17.638\n      modernbert_uniform_eval_ppl: 17.690\n      modernbert_adaptive_improvement: 0.052\n      tfidf_adaptive_improvement: 0.040\n      improvement_ratio: 1.30\n      modernbert_b_star_mean: 0.82\n      modernbert_b_star_median: 0.45\n      modernbert_b_star_std: 1.15\n      gpu_hours: 7.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      更高 AUC → 更精确 q-scores → 更准确 reweighting → 更低 PPL。\n      ModernBERT adaptive PPL 17.638 vs TF-IDF 17.650，改善 0.012。\n      但关键 finding：30% 提升对应 AUC 从 0.939→0.986 的 0.047 差距——边际递减。\n      TF-IDF 已捕获 77% 的 reweighting value。b* 分布因 q-score 更 bimodal 而更窄更低\n      (median 0.45 vs 0.87)——adaptive 自动适应 detector 质量差异。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9: Detector quality ablation — 训练结果\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 9: Detector AUC vs PPL improvement\"\n    analysis: >\n      Lightweight detector sufficiency：TF-IDF (AUC=0.939) 已实现 77% 的 reweighting value，\n      成本仅为 ModernBERT 的 1/100。adaptive b* 在两种 detector 下都有效——detector-agnostic。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P1: Cross-Generator\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Cross-generator data (Llama-3.2-1B generates, Qwen3-0.6B trains)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_cross_generator_datagen\"\n    description: \"用不同模型家族生成合成数据，测试跨生成器鲁棒性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      detector_auc_cross_gen: 0.952\n      q_score_mean: 0.62\n      q_score_std: 0.38\n      q_score_median: 0.73\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.44\n      datagen_gpu_hours: 7.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨模型族的 generation artifacts 更容易被 n-gram 特征区分\n      （Llama 和 Qwen 有不同 tokenizer/训练数据/生成模式），AUC 提升至 0.952。\n      q-score 分布稍偏高：Llama 生成文本被更 confidently 识别为 synthetic。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: q-score distribution (same-gen vs cross-gen)\"\n    analysis: \"Cross-generator 场景下 detector 自然表现更好，反映 real-world web corpus 特征。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator training (adaptive + uniform, ρ=0.4)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_cross_generator_training\"\n    description: \"Llama 生成数据 + Qwen 训练，测试 adaptive 跨生成器稳定性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      cross_gen_uniform_ppl: 17.720\n      cross_gen_adaptive_ppl: 17.670\n      cross_gen_improvement: 0.050\n      cross_gen_b_star_mean: 1.32\n      cross_gen_b_star_median: 0.83\n      gpu_hours: 7.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-generator uniform PPL (17.720) 比 same-generator (17.690) 略高——\n      Llama-generated text 的 distributional mismatch 更大。\n      Adaptive 改善 0.050 PPL，与 same-generator 0.040 相当甚至略好——\n      因为 cross-gen contamination 更易检测 (AUC=0.952 vs 0.939)。\n      b* 分布与 same-gen 高度一致 (median 0.83 vs 0.87)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 10: Cross-generator results\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4: b* distribution (same-gen vs cross-gen)\"\n    analysis: >\n      方法 generator-agnostic：不需要知道 contamination 来源模型，只需 detector scores。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P1: Llama-3.2-3B Scale-Up\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Llama-3.2-3B environment setup + data prep\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_llama3b_setup\"\n    description: \"下载 3B 模型，准备训练数据。\"\n    expected_results:\n      model_downloaded: true\n      model_params_B: 3.21\n      gradient_checkpointing_needed: true\n      effective_batch_size: 16\n      detector_scores_reused: true\n      setup_gpu_hours: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      TF-IDF detector scores 可复用——基于文本特征，与训练模型无关。\n      3B 训练需 gradient checkpointing，增加约 20% 训练时间但不影响收敛。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"环境就绪。保持 effective batch_size=16 确保 b* 分布可直接对比。\"\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_llama3b_uniform\"\n    description: \"3B 模型 uniform 基线。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 12.85\n      eval_loss: 2.554\n      train_loss: 5.89\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 38000\n      gpu_hours: 11.5\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型 holdout PPL ~12.85——显著低于 0.6B 的 17.69。\n      contamination degradation ~2.7% (clean 3B ~12.50, contaminated 12.85)——\n      比 0.6B 的 ~1.4% 更大，因为 3B 有更多参数记忆合成数据的 distributional artifacts。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 11: Cross-model results (0.6B vs 3B)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: Cross-model comparison bar chart\"\n    analysis: \"3B contamination degradation 2.7% > 0.6B 1.4%，预示 reweighting 效益更大。\"\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_llama3b_adaptive\"\n    description: \"3B 上的 adaptive b*——验证跨模型规模泛化 + 效应放大。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 12.69\n      eval_loss: 2.541\n      train_loss: 6.12\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 39500\n      gpu_hours: 12.0\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.16\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 1.24\n      effect_amplification_vs_06B: 4.0\n      b_star_mean: 1.41\n      b_star_median: 0.88\n      b_star_std: 1.97\n      b_star_pct_below_0_5: 20.8\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 16.2\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改善 0.16 (12.85→12.69, 1.24% relative)——0.6B 的 4.0× 放大。\n      效应放大机制：3B 对 data quality 更敏感（更多参数 = 更精细适配训练分布），\n      reweighting 的 clean signal 在 3B 上被更充分利用。\n      b* 分布与 0.6B 几乎完全一致 (median 0.88 vs 0.87)——\n      因为 b* 仅从 per-batch q-score 推导，与模型架构无关。\n      同一 b* 在 3B 上产生更大 PPL 改善——universal applicability 的最强证据。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 11: Cross-model — Adaptive 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: adaptive bars 标注 4.0× amplification\"\n      - \"Figure 8b: b* distribution overlay (0.6B vs 3B)——几乎完全重合\"\n    analysis: >\n      三层强证据：(1) 4.0× 效应放大彻底回应 effect size concern；\n      (2) b* 分布跨模型完全一致——method is model-agnostic；\n      (3) 无需 per-model validation——b* 是数据属性而非模型属性。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P1: Additional Baselines\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Detect-and-remove baseline (threshold=0.5, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_baseline_detect_remove\"\n    description: \"硬阈值过滤 baseline——q>0.5 直接丢弃。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.668\n      eval_loss: 2.8725\n      train_loss: 6.85\n      total_steps: 3540\n      retained_data_fraction: 0.537\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.022\n      improvement_fraction_of_adaptive: 0.55\n      gpu_hours: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      q>0.5 移除 46.3% 数据——仅保留 ~107M tokens。\n      PPL 17.668 优于 uniform (17.690) 但逊于 adaptive (17.650)，改善量仅为 adaptive 的 55%。\n      原因：(1) 数据损失——detector 不完美 (AUC=0.939)，mid_range 有大量 clean-but-borderline 被错误移除；\n      (2) 丧失细粒度——binary 决策 vs adaptive 的连续权重控制。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 12: Baseline comparison\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 10: Baseline bar chart\"\n    analysis: \"Soft reweighting 优于 hard filtering——连续权重更能容忍检测误差。\"\n\n  - name: \"Random reweighting baseline (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_baseline_random_reweight\"\n    description: \"随机权重 baseline——验证 detector signal 是 load-bearing。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.695\n      eval_loss: 2.874\n      train_loss: 7.28\n      total_steps: 6103\n      ppl_vs_uniform: -0.005\n      ppl_vs_adaptive: -0.045\n      gpu_hours: 3.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      随机权重 (i.i.d. uniform [0,1]) 不含 contamination signal。\n      PPL 17.695 与 uniform 17.690 几乎无差异 (Δ=0.005)——\n      随机噪声在 expectation 上等价于 uniform，仅增加少量 gradient variance。\n      与 adaptive 的 0.045 PPL 差距证明改善 100% 来自 detector-informed weighting。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 12: Baseline comparison — Random 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 10: Random 与 uniform 重合，凸显 adaptive 的 detector-driven gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      最清晰的 ablation：random ≈ uniform → detector signal 是必要条件。\n      adaptive 的改善来自精准识别和 downweight contamination，不是 weight diversity 或 regularization。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P2: Domain-Skewed + Downstream\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Domain-skewed injection (code-heavy contamination, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: \"p2_domain_skewed\"\n    description: \"合成数据集中注入 code/technical 域，测试非均匀域分布鲁棒性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_eval_ppl: 17.730\n      adaptive_eval_ppl: 17.680\n      adaptive_improvement: 0.050\n      b_star_mean: 1.52\n      b_star_median: 0.95\n      b_star_per_domain_code_median: 1.35\n      b_star_per_domain_general_median: 0.42\n      gpu_hours: 6.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Code-heavy contamination (70% code) 使 uniform PPL 略高 (17.730)。\n      Adaptive 改善 0.050 PPL。关键：b* 的 per-batch 自适应——\n      code-heavy batch b* median=1.35，general batch=0.42。\n      per-batch b* 根据每个 batch 的 contamination 程度动态调整。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 13: Domain-skewed results\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 11: Per-domain b* distribution (code vs general)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain-skewed 强化 per-batch b* 叙事：\"real web corpora have domain-skewed\n      contamination; adaptive b* handles both uniform and skewed injection.\"\n\n  - name: \"Downstream eval (MMLU/HellaSwag on Llama-3.2-3B checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: \"p2_downstream_eval\"\n    description: \"验证 PPL 改善是否转移至下游任务。\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_mmlu_acc: 31.8\n      adaptive_mmlu_acc: 32.5\n      mmlu_delta_abs: 0.7\n      uniform_hellaswag_acc: 52.1\n      adaptive_hellaswag_acc: 53.2\n      hellaswag_delta_abs: 1.1\n      uniform_selfbleu_4gram: 0.42\n      adaptive_selfbleu_4gram: 0.38\n      gpu_hours: 1.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改善 (12.85→12.69, 1.24%) 部分转移至下游。\n      MMLU +0.7%：更干净预训练 → factual knowledge 更准确编码。\n      HellaSwag +1.1%：更依赖 language model quality (sentence completion)，PPL 的直接度量。\n      Self-BLEU 0.42→0.38：adaptive 减少 synthetic patterns 导致的 repetitive outputs。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 14: Downstream eval (uniform vs adaptive, 3B)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 12: Downstream task improvement bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      PPL→downstream 转移验证方法实际价值。MMLU +0.7%、HellaSwag +1.1% 在 200M tokens 下可观。\n      回应 \"does PPL matter?\" → 是的，且效应在下游可测量。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24277,"cache_read_input_tokens":38239,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24277},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"888cd91d-1c82-4675-babe-f7890b7b03a7","uuid":"cc977971-04c8-4a11-a446-688211457a11"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":534216,"duration_api_ms":535022,"num_turns":6,"result":"Now I have the full context — existing data, previous dream predictions, and the current D023 tier definitions. Let me generate the calibrated predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Dual-constraint adaptive b* 是 principled minimum-intervention 方法，ESS-only head-to-head 证明 α_eff 质量下界是\n  load-bearing 组件——去掉它，方法退化为 over-downweighting，PPL 接近 uniform 水平。τ sweep 证明方法对 τ 完全不敏感，\n  任意 τ∈[0.5,0.9] 均 within 0.023 PPL 工作。Golden Ratio oracle 持有已知比例信息但仍不优于 adaptive——per-batch\n  自适应比 oracle fixed-weight 更有效。ρ=0.6 效应放大 2.5× 直接回应 \"small effect size\" reviewer concern。\n  论文叙事核心：min-intervention principle 不仅理论优美，而且实证优于 max-intervention。α_eff 是方法的核心贡献而非装饰。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: Grid-b Low Extension\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed42 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_grid_b_low_seed42\"\n    description: \"在 b=0.5 以下扩展 grid 搜索，确认 grid-best 不在搜索边界外。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.681\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.668\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.654\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.42\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.95\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.28\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      b=0.1 的 w=(1-q)^0.1 对高 q 样本 (q≈0.85) 权重降至 (0.15)^0.1≈0.83——几乎无过滤效果，\n      PPL 仅比 uniform (17.690) 好 0.009。b=0.3 达到 17.654，与 b=0.5 (17.651) 仅差 0.003，\n      因为在 TF-IDF detector 的 bimodal q-score 分布下，b=0.3-0.5 区间的 ESS 和 α_eff 都在最优平台内。\n      train_loss 逐步上升因为更高 b 对 contaminated samples 的 loss contribution 压缩更多。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve (b=0.1...5.0) × 3 seeds — seed42 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2 (b-PPL curve): b=0.1/0.2/0.3 扩展 seed42 曲线左侧，确认 broad minimum 在 b∈[0.3,0.5]\"\n    analysis: >\n      seed42 的 b=0.3 与 b=0.5 差距仅 0.003 PPL，远小于 seed variance (~0.01)。\n      证实 b=0.5 不是边界伪影，最优区间是宽阔的 [0.3, 0.5] 平台。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed123 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_grid_b_low_seed123\"\n    description: \"Finer grid 扩展 seed123，验证跨 seed 一致性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.674\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.656\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.641\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.43\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.96\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.29\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed123 在 MVP 中一贯表现最优（grid-best b=0.5 PPL=17.638 最低），\n      b=0.3 的 17.641 与 b=0.5 的 17.638 仅差 0.003，同样在 seed variance 内。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve — seed123 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: seed123 曲线叠加，三条曲线在 b∈[0.3,0.5] 重合验证平台稳定性\"\n    analysis: \"跨 seed 一致性确认，seed123 的 b=0.3 同样在平台内。\"\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed456 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_grid_b_low_seed456\"\n    description: \"Finer grid 扩展 seed456，完成 3-seed b<0.5 曲线。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.684\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.670\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.653\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.40\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.93\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.26\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed456 的 uniform PPL 略高 (17.700)，对应更大的改善空间。\n      b=0.3 (17.653) 与 b=0.5 (17.650) 仅差 0.003，第三次独立确认 [0.3, 0.5] 平台。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve — seed456 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: seed456 曲线完成三 seed 覆盖\"\n    analysis: \"3/3 seeds 确认 b=0.3 和 b=0.5 在噪声范围内无显著差异，消除 boundary concern。\"\n\n  - name: \"Post-hoc eval for all 9 b<0.5 checkpoints\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_grid_b_low_eval\"\n    description: \"对 9 个 b<0.5 训练 checkpoint 统一进行 holdout 评估。\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_9_eval_ppl_collected: true\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_1: 17.680\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_2: 17.665\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_3: 17.649\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_5: 17.646\n      cross_seed_std_b0_3: 0.007\n      cross_seed_std_b0_5: 0.007\n      b0_3_vs_b0_5_paired_t_pvalue: 0.42\n      updated_finer_grid_best_b: 0.5\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨 seed 平均后 b=0.3 (17.649) 与 b=0.5 (17.646) 差异仅 0.003，\n      paired t-test p=0.42 远不显著。曲线形态为不对称的 slow-entry / fast-exit：\n      b=0→0.3 单调下降，b=0.3→0.5 平台，b=0.5→1.0 急剧上升。\n      这种不对称性解释了 adaptive b* median=0.87 为何仍然有效——b 偏高的 PPL 代价远小于偏低。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: 完整 extended grid-b PPL curve (b=0.1...5.0) × 3 seeds\"\n      - \"Table 2 注脚: paired t-test b=0.3 vs b=0.5, p=0.42 (n.s.)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: 完整 b-PPL 曲线（27 数据点），标注 [0.3,0.5] 平台 + adaptive b* 直方图叠加\"\n      - \"Figure 2 inset: 放大 b∈[0,1] 区域的不对称 penalty structure\"\n    analysis: >\n      b=0.5 boundary concern 完全消除。最优区间是 [0.3, 0.5] 宽平台。\n      adaptive b* 的 p25=0.54 恰好落在平台右沿，结合不对称 penalty structure，median=0.87 是合理的保守选择。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: ESS-Only Baseline (★ KEY EXPERIMENT)\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"ESS-only adaptive baseline: max{b : ESS≥n_min} (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_ess_only_baseline\"\n    description: >\n      Head-to-head 对比 min-intervention (dual-constraint) vs max-intervention (ESS-only)。\n      ESS-only 选择满足 ESS≥n_min 的最大 b——最大干预。如果 dual > ESS-only，\n      α_eff 质量下界的独立贡献被实证确认。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.685\n      eval_loss: 2.8729\n      train_loss: 8.94\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10500\n      delta_vs_dual_constraint: 0.035\n      delta_vs_uniform: 0.005\n      b_star_mean: 2.10\n      b_star_median: 1.85\n      b_star_std: 2.78\n      b_star_p25: 0.0\n      b_star_p75: 3.95\n      b_star_pct_zero: 49.9\n      b_star_pct_above_3: 28.5\n      b_star_pct_above_5: 14.2\n      b_star_mean_reweighted: 4.18\n      b_star_median_reweighted: 3.82\n      ess_mean_reweighted: 2.08\n      ess_std_reweighted: 0.12\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 0.0\n      ess_binding_pct: 50.1\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      ESS-only 使用 max{b : ESS≥n_min} 选择每个 batch 的 b*。在所有需 reweighting 的 batch 中（50.1%），\n      b* 始终被推到 ESS 上界 b_ESS。Q1 数据显示 α_eff binding batches 中 b_ESS≈4.15，而 dual-constraint\n      仅选 b*=1.67。ESS-only 强制所有 reweighted batch 用 b=b_ESS，导致：\n      (1) 过度 downweight——contaminated samples 权重趋近 0，有效梯度信号大幅减少；\n      (2) ESS 均值仅 2.08（几乎触及 n_min=2.0），每个 batch 的有效样本量极低；\n      (3) gradient variance 极高——每步仅~2个有效样本贡献梯度，optimization 噪声增大。\n      PPL 17.685 仅比 uniform (17.690) 好 0.005——ESS-only 的 over-downweighting 几乎完全抵消了\n      contamination removal 的收益。对比 dual-constraint 的 17.650 (delta=0.035)，\n      min-intervention 明确优于 max-intervention，差距 0.035 ≥ seed variance (σ≈0.009)。\n      核心因果链：ESS-only 在 40% 的 reweighted batches（原 α_eff binding）中选择了 b=4.18 而非 1.67，\n      这些 batches 的 ESS 从 2.60 (dual, 30% 余量) 降至 2.08 (ESS-only, 无余量)——\n      过度清洁浪费了有效样本，gradient variance 增大导致训练收敛变差。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1: Dual-constraint vs ESS-only head-to-head (seed42)\"\n      - \"Table 1 子表: b* distribution comparison (dual vs ESS-only)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1: b* 分布对比直方图——dual (median=0.87) vs ESS-only (median=1.85)，标注 2.5× 差距\"\n      - \"Figure 1b: 双轴图——α_eff(b) 和 ESS(b) 曲线 + b_τ 和 b_ESS 标注 + dual 和 ESS-only 的 b* 选择点\"\n      - \"Figure 1c: ESS 分布对比——dual (mean=2.60 in α_eff binding) vs ESS-only (mean=2.08)\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是全文最重要的实验结果。三层证据：\n      (1) PPL gap: dual 17.650 vs ESS-only 17.685, delta=0.035 > seed variance (0.009)——统计显著。\n      (2) 机制清晰: ESS-only 在 α_eff binding batches 中 b* 从 1.67 飙至 4.18 (2.5×)，\n          ESS 从 2.60 骤降至 2.08——过度 downweight 的直接证据。\n      (3) 论文叙事: \"α_eff 不是装饰——它提供了必要的质量下界，防止方法过度清洁。\n          去掉 α_eff 约束后，方法退化为 max-intervention，PPL 退化至接近 uniform 水平。\"\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: τ Sweep (★ KEY EXPERIMENT)\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"τ sweep (τ=0.5/0.6/0.7/0.8/0.9, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_tau_sweep\"\n    description: >\n      验证方法对 τ 的不敏感性。τ 是 empirical hyperparameter with theoretical motivation，\n      sweep 证明任意合理 τ 均可工作，无需 dataset-specific tuning。\n    expected_results:\n      tau_05_eval_ppl: 17.668\n      tau_06_eval_ppl: 17.655\n      tau_07_eval_ppl: 17.645\n      tau_08_eval_ppl: 17.650\n      tau_09_eval_ppl: 17.660\n      tau_095_eval_ppl: 17.666\n      ppl_range: 0.023\n      ppl_std: 0.008\n      ppl_mean: 17.654\n      all_better_than_uniform: true\n      all_better_than_ess_only: true\n      tau_05_b_star_mean: 0.62\n      tau_05_b_star_median: 0.38\n      tau_05_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 8.5\n      tau_06_b_star_mean: 0.85\n      tau_06_b_star_median: 0.52\n      tau_06_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 13.8\n      tau_07_b_star_mean: 1.12\n      tau_07_b_star_median: 0.68\n      tau_07_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 17.4\n      tau_08_b_star_mean: 1.40\n      tau_08_b_star_median: 0.87\n      tau_08_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 20.2\n      tau_09_b_star_mean: 1.95\n      tau_09_b_star_median: 1.28\n      tau_09_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 31.5\n      tau_095_b_star_mean: 2.35\n      tau_095_b_star_median: 1.62\n      tau_095_alpha_eff_binding_pct: 38.8\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      τ 控制质量阈值的高低：低 τ → b_τ 小 → 轻度清洁；高 τ → b_τ 大 → 深度清洁。\n      PPL 对 τ 不敏感的根本原因是 b-PPL 曲线的平台效应：\n      (1) τ=0.5 (b_star_mean=0.62): 质量阈值极低，α_eff 约束在极小 b 就满足，\n          多数 batch 的 b* 由 ESS ceiling 主导 (91.5%)。轻度 reweighting 仍优于 uniform (17.668 vs 17.690)\n          但未充分利用 detector signal。\n      (2) τ=0.7 (b_star_mean=1.12): 与 τ=0.8 (1.40) 差距不大，PPL 达到 sweep 最优 17.645——\n          这是因为 b*≈1.12 恰好落在 b-PPL 曲线的最优平台附近，且 α_eff binding 比例 (17.4%)\n          在此区间提供了恰好足够的质量约束。\n      (3) τ=0.9 (b_star_mean=1.95): 高质量阈值推高 b*，31.5% 的 batch 受 α_eff 约束。\n          PPL 微升至 17.660——接近但未触及 ESS-only 的过度清洁区间。\n      (4) τ=0.95 (b_star_mean=2.35): 进一步推高，开始接近 ESS-only 行为，PPL 17.666。\n      关键发现：PPL range 仅 0.023 (17.645-17.668)，std=0.008，所有 τ 值都优于 uniform (17.690)\n      和 ESS-only (17.685)。这证明 τ 是 genuinely insensitive 的——\n      \"any τ∈[0.5,0.9] works without dataset-specific tuning\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: τ sensitivity sweep (τ=0.5...0.95) — PPL + b* stats\"\n      - \"Table 3 子表: α_eff binding percentage vs τ\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: τ vs eval_ppl curve — flat band (17.645-17.668) 标注 ±0.012 around mean\"\n      - \"Figure 3b: τ vs b_star_mean — monotonic increase showing τ's control of intervention intensity\"\n      - \"Figure 3c: τ vs α_eff_binding_pct — monotonic from 8.5% to 38.8%\"\n    analysis: >\n      τ sweep 是 Claim 3 的核心证据。PPL std=0.008 < 0.015（best 档上界），\n      range 0.023 < 0.03（best 档通过标准）。所有 6 个 τ 值都优于 uniform 和 ESS-only。\n      同时 τ sweep 揭示了有趣的结构：b_star_mean 随 τ 单调递增 (0.62→2.35)，\n      α_eff binding % 同步增加 (8.5%→38.8%)——τ 精确控制了 α_eff 约束的 \"tightness\"。\n      但 PPL 对这些大幅变化近乎不变——方法的鲁棒性来自 b-PPL 曲线的宽平台，\n      而非 τ 恰好命中某个特定最优值。论文表述：\"τ is a dial that controls how much quality\n      assurance to apply; the method works across the entire reasonable range because\n      the PPL landscape has a broad optimum.\"\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: Golden Ratio Oracle Baseline (★ KEY EXPERIMENT)\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Golden Ratio oracle baseline (w=1/φ, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_golden_ratio_baseline\"\n    description: >\n      Fixed weight w*=1/φ≈0.618 for synthetic, 1.0 for real。已知比例 oracle——\n      如果 adaptive 不劣于 GR oracle，则证明 per-batch adaptation > oracle fixed weight。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.665\n      eval_loss: 2.8717\n      train_loss: 8.52\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10350\n      delta_vs_uniform: 0.025\n      delta_vs_adaptive: -0.015\n      effective_b_equivalent: 0.25\n      weight_synthetic_mean: 0.618\n      weight_real_mean: 1.0\n      ess_mean: 3.28\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      Golden Ratio 使用 oracle 信息（已知 contamination ratio k=0.4）推导理论最优权重\n      w*=1/φ≈0.618 for synthetic samples (q>0.5), 1.0 for real (q≤0.5)。\n      PPL 17.665：优于 uniform (17.690, Δ=0.025) 但逊于 adaptive (17.650, Δ=0.015)。\n      逊于 adaptive 的原因：\n      (1) Fixed weight 忽略 per-sample contamination severity——q=0.6 (borderline) 和 q=0.99\n          (near-certain synthetic) 获得相同权重 0.618，而 adaptive 通过 (1-q)^b* 给予\n          不同强度的 downweight。\n      (2) Binary classification (q>0.5 vs ≤0.5) 丢失了 detector 的连续 calibration 信息。\n          TF-IDF detector 的 mid_range (q∈[0.2,0.8]) 占 46.3%——这些 borderline 样本在 GR 中\n          被粗暴地二分，而 adaptive 的连续权重更精确。\n      (3) Global fixed weight 不适应 per-batch contamination 密度——某些 batch 80% synthetic，\n          某些仅 20%，但 GR 给所有 synthetic 同一权重 0.618。\n      Effective b-equivalent: w=0.618 对 q_median_synthetic≈0.85 等价于 (0.15)^b=0.618 → b≈0.25。\n      这远低于 adaptive mean b*=1.40，说明 GR 的 downweight 力度整体偏弱。\n      但 GR 的 ESS=3.28 远高于 adaptive (ESS≈2.3 when reweighting)——GR 保留了更多有效样本，\n      只是没有精准地 target high-contamination samples。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: Method comparison — Golden Ratio oracle 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4: weight distribution comparison——GR (binary 0.618/1.0) vs adaptive (continuous)\"\n      - \"Figure 4b: Per-sample weight vs q-score scatter——adaptive 展示 smooth nonlinear mapping, GR 展示 step function\"\n    analysis: >\n      Golden Ratio oracle 持有方法所不需要的信息（已知 contamination ratio），但仍不优于 adaptive。\n      这强化了两个 claim：(1) Claim 3——不需要已知比例，因为即使有也没用（GR 弱于 adaptive）；\n      (2) Claim 1——per-batch adaptive b* 的连续权重映射优于任何 fixed-weight scheme。\n      论文表述：\"Even an oracle with known contamination proportion cannot match\n      per-batch adaptive b*, because fixed weights ignore within-batch heterogeneity.\"\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: n_min Ablation\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"n_min=1 ablation (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_1\"\n    description: \"极松 ESS 约束 (n_min=1)——允许 b* 过高，可能 over-downweight。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.700\n      eval_loss: 2.8735\n      train_loss: 7.85\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10400\n      b_star_mean: 2.95\n      b_star_median: 1.73\n      b_star_std: 3.82\n      b_star_p25: 0.71\n      b_star_p75: 3.45\n      b_star_pct_above_5: 12.8\n      ess_mean_reweighted: 1.35\n      delta_vs_nmin2: -0.050\n      delta_vs_uniform: -0.010\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=1 释放 ESS 上界约束——b* 不再受 ESS≥2 限制，α_eff 优化可以把 b* 推到极高值。\n      b* 分布大幅右移：median 1.73 (vs n_min=2 的 0.87)，12.8% 的 batches b*>5。\n      在高 b* batches 中，contaminated samples 权重趋近 0，有效只有 ~1.35 个样本贡献梯度——\n      gradient variance 极高。PPL 17.700 比 n_min=2 的 17.650 差 0.050，甚至微劣于 uniform 17.690。\n      这验证了 ESS 上界约束的必要性：α_eff alone 不够，需要 ESS ceiling 防止 over-downweighting。\n      没有 ESS 约束，α_eff 的单调递增性驱使 b* 越大越好（α_eff 越高），但代价是 gradient 不稳定。\n      dual-constraint 的 min-intervention 语义在此得到对称验证：\n      (a) ESS-only (17.685)——没有 α_eff 下界 → max-intervention → 性能差；\n      (b) n_min=1 (17.700)——ESS 约束过松 → 也接近 max-intervention → 性能差。\n      两者从不同方向证明了 dual-constraint (17.650) 的平衡是最优的。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: n_min sensitivity ablation (n_min=1,2,3,4,5)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: n_min vs eval_ppl U-shape curve — n_min=2 是 sweet spot\"\n      - \"Figure 5 inset: b* distribution comparison across n_min values\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_min=1 和 ESS-only 从不同方向验证了 dual-constraint 的必要性。\n      ESS ceiling 防止极端 over-downweighting (n_min=1 case)；\n      α_eff floor 防止无差别 max-downweighting (ESS-only case)。\n      论文用 n_min sensitivity curve 展示清晰的 U-shape：\n      n_min=1 (over-aggressive, 17.700) → n_min=2 (optimal, 17.650) →\n      n_min=3 (fragile, 17.690) → n_min≥4 (uniform, 17.690)。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=4 ablation (=batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_4\"\n    description: \"n_min=batch_size → ESS 约束要求所有样本有效 → b*=0 → uniform 退化。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      eval_loss: 2.8730\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10300\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_zero: 100.0\n      equivalent_to_uniform: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=4=batch_size 时，ESS 约束要求每 batch 有效样本量≥4（全部有效）。\n      任何 b>0 都会降低 contaminated samples 权重使 ESS<4，因此 b* 被钳制为 0。\n      PPL=17.690 与 uniform 完全一致——验证当 ESS 约束完全绑定时算法正确退化。\n      这是 sanity check：改善确实来自非零 b*（即 reweighting），而非实现副作用。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: n_min sensitivity — n_min=4 行，标注 '=uniform'\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: n_min=4 点与 uniform baseline 重合\"\n    analysis: \"完美的退化验证。n_min=4 → b*=0 → uniform，PPL 精确匹配。排除 confounding factor。\"\n\n  - name: \"n_min=5 ablation (>batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_5\"\n    description: \"n_min > batch_size 的退化情况——不可满足约束。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      eval_loss: 2.8730\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10300\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_zero: 100.0\n      equivalent_to_uniform: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=5>batch_size=4，ESS 上限为 batch_size=4 < n_min=5，约束不可能满足。\n      b* 始终为 0，与 n_min=4 完全相同——uniform training。\n      作为 boundary case 完成 sensitivity curve 右端。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: n_min sensitivity — n_min=5 行，标注 'degenerate'\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: n_min=5 与 n_min=4 重合在 uniform baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      完整 n_min ablation 展示 phase transition：\n      n_min=1 (over-aggressive, 17.700) → n_min=2 (optimal, 17.650) →\n      n_min=3 (fragile, 17.690) → n_min≥4 (degenerate/uniform, 17.690)。\n      n_min=2 是唯一稳定工作的值，但这不是 \"another hyperparameter to tune\"——\n      它有明确物理含义（\"每 batch 至少 2 个有效样本\"），且 batch_size 消融将证明\n      knife-edge 是 batch_size=4 的 artifact。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: Batch Size Ablation\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"batch_size=8 + grad_accum=2 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42, adaptive)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_batchsize_8\"\n    description: >\n      扩大 micro-batch 至 8，n_min=2 的 ESS 约束从 50% 放宽到 25%——\n      验证 n_min knife-edge 是 batch_size=4 的 artifact。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.643\n      eval_loss: 2.8705\n      train_loss: 7.48\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10800\n      b_star_mean: 1.58\n      b_star_median: 1.05\n      b_star_std: 2.15\n      b_star_p25: 0.62\n      b_star_p75: 1.85\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 19.8\n      ess_mean_reweighted: 4.35\n      ess_std_reweighted: 1.42\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 28.5\n      ess_binding_pct: 21.6\n      nmin2_effective: true\n      nmin3_also_works: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=8 时 n_min/batch_size=2/8=25%，ESS 约束大幅放松。\n      关键变化：(1) b* 分布向右展开——更多 batches 的 b* 可以超越原 ESS ceiling，\n      mean 从 1.40 (bs=4) 升至 1.58 (bs=8)，因为 ESS 余量更大允许更精确的 α_eff targeting。\n      (2) ESS_mean=4.35（远高于 n_min=2），每 batch 有 ~4.35 个有效样本——gradient 更稳定。\n      (3) α_eff binding 比例从 20.2% (bs=4) 升至 28.5% (bs=8)——α_eff 约束有更多空间发挥。\n      PPL 17.643 比 bs=4 (17.650) 好 0.007——改善来自 8 样本/batch 提供了更精确的\n      per-batch q-score 统计量，b* 估计的 batch-level variance 降低。\n      关键验证：n_min=3 在 bs=8 下也能稳定工作（n_min/bs=3/8=37.5% vs 3/4=75%），\n      证明 n_min=3 在 bs=4 的不稳定是 ratio 过高的 artifact。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Batch size ablation (bs=4,8,16) — PPL + b* + ESS stats\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6: batch_size vs eval_ppl — monotonic improvement\"\n      - \"Figure 6b: b* and ESS distributions across batch sizes — ESS headroom visually increases\"\n    analysis: >\n      batch_size=8 验证两点：(1) n_min=2 在更大 batch 下更加稳健，knife-edge 消失；\n      (2) α_eff binding 比例增加至 28.5%，α_eff 约束的独立贡献在大 batch 下更突出。\n      论文表述：\"At batch_size=8, the ESS constraint relaxes and α_eff becomes the\n      binding constraint in 28.5% of reweighted batches (vs 20.2% at batch_size=4),\n      confirming that dual-constraint becomes more valuable at practical batch sizes.\"\n\n  - name: \"batch_size=16 + grad_accum=1 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42, adaptive)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_batchsize_16\"\n    description: >\n      micro-batch=16，n_min=2 仅占 12.5%——ESS 几乎不约束，\n      α_eff 成为主导约束。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.638\n      eval_loss: 2.8700\n      train_loss: 7.45\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 11200\n      b_star_mean: 1.65\n      b_star_median: 1.12\n      b_star_std: 2.22\n      b_star_p25: 0.65\n      b_star_p75: 1.98\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 21.5\n      ess_mean_reweighted: 8.82\n      ess_std_reweighted: 2.65\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 35.2\n      ess_binding_pct: 14.9\n      nmin2_effective: true\n      nmin3_effective: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=16 时 n_min/batch_size=12.5%，ESS 约束几乎不限制 b*。\n      α_eff binding 比例升至 35.2%——超过 ESS binding 的 14.9%，α_eff 成为主导约束。\n      这意味着 b* = inf{b : α_eff≥τ} 在大多数需 reweighting 的 batch 中就是最终选择，\n      ESS 仅在极端 batch 中起保护作用。\n      PPL 17.638——全 batch-size 系列最优。改善来自：\n      (1) 16 个样本/batch 提供更精确的 α_eff 和 ESS 估计——batch-level noise 大幅降低；\n      (2) ESS=8.82 保证了每步 ~9 个有效样本——gradient variance 极低；\n      (3) b* 分布更集中在理论最优区间——median 1.12 对应的 PPL 贡献最优。\n      关键发现：bs=16 证明在实际使用的 batch size 下（16-64），\n      dual-constraint 方法中 α_eff 是主导约束，ESS 仅为 safety net。\n      这进一步强化了 α_eff 作为方法核心组件的地位。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Batch size ablation — bs=16 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6: bs=16 点标注 'α_eff dominant regime'\"\n      - \"Figure 6c: α_eff vs ESS binding ratio across batch sizes — cross-over at bs≈12\"\n    analysis: >\n      batch_size=16 是论文最重要的 scaling argument 之一：\n      (1) PPL 持续改善 (17.650→17.643→17.638)——方法在大 batch 下更优；\n      (2) α_eff 成为主导约束 (35.2% vs 14.9%)——在实际 batch size 下，\n          dual-constraint ≈ α_eff constraint + ESS safety net；\n      (3) n_min knife-edge 在 bs=16 完全消失——n_min=2,3 都稳定工作。\n      论文表述：\"At practical batch sizes (≥16), α_eff is the primary constraint\n      governing b* selection in the majority of reweighted batches, while ESS serves\n      as a safety net that activates only in extreme cases.\"\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P0: ρ=0.6 Contamination Scaling\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Data generation for ρ=0.6 (Qwen3-0.6B, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_datagen\"\n    description: \"生成 60% 污染率训练数据集并用 TF-IDF+LR 评分。\"\n    expected_results:\n      scored_data_ready: true\n      contamination_ratio_actual: 0.6\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      q_score_mean: 0.68\n      q_score_std: 0.35\n      q_score_median: 0.78\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.41\n      detector_auc_on_60pct: 0.936\n      datagen_gpu_hours: 3.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 污染 → 更多高 q-score 样本。q_score_mean 从 0.60 (40%) 升至 0.68，\n      median 从 0.707 升至 0.78，因为 synthetic 占比增大推高分布上半部。\n      AUC 微降至 0.936 (vs 0.939) 因为 class imbalance 从 40:60 变为 60:40。\n      mid_range_ratio 降至 0.41——更多样本被推向高 q 区域。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: q-score 分布对比图 (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)\"\n    analysis: \"数据准备就绪。q-score 分布如预期偏移。\"\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_uniform\"\n    description: \"60% 污染率下的 uniform 基线。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.15\n      eval_loss: 2.899\n      train_loss: 7.48\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 12000\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      从 ρ=0.4 (17.690) 到 ρ=0.6，uniform PPL 上升至 18.15 (+0.46, +2.6%)。\n      更多合成数据意味着 60% 的梯度来自 generator 扭曲的文本，\n      累积的分布偏移导致 holdout PPL 显著退化。上升幅度超线性：\n      40% 时 PPL 比 clean (~17.45) 高 0.24，60% 高 0.70——\n      符合 strong model collapse 文献的超线性污染效应预测。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Contamination scaling (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 7: Contamination rate vs PPL — uniform series\"\n    analysis: \"60% uniform PPL 18.15 确立 baseline gap，为 effect amplification 提供基础。\"\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_adaptive\"\n    description: \"60% 污染下的 adaptive b*，验证效应放大 + b* 轨迹追踪。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.05\n      eval_loss: 2.894\n      train_loss: 7.92\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 11500\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.10\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 0.55\n      effect_amplification_vs_40pct: 2.50\n      b_star_mean: 2.12\n      b_star_median: 1.45\n      b_star_std: 2.55\n      b_star_p25: 0.85\n      b_star_p75: 2.62\n      b_star_pct_below_0_5: 11.8\n      b_star_pct_0_5_to_1: 23.5\n      b_star_pct_1_to_2: 31.8\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 32.9\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 25.5\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 从 18.15 (uniform) 降至 18.05，改善 0.10 PPL (0.55% relative)。\n      对比 ρ=0.4 的 0.04 PPL (0.23%)，效应放大 2.5×——在 best 档 [1.5×, ∞) 范围内。\n      效应放大的因果链：\n      (1) 60% 污染 → 每 batch ~60% 样本需 downweight（vs 40%）→ reweighting 覆盖面更广；\n      (2) 更多 contaminated samples → α_eff(b) 曲线右移 → b_τ 更高 → b* 自然上调；\n      (3) 更高 b* → synthetic gradient 压缩更彻底 → clean signal 占比更高 → PPL 改善更大。\n      b* 分布右移：median 0.87→1.45, mean 1.40→2.12。这是 b*-tracks-optimum 的直接证据——\n      当 contamination 增加时，adaptive 框架自动推高 b* 匹配新最优区间。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Contamination scaling — Adaptive 行\"\n      - \"Table 8: b* distribution summary (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 7: Effect amplification bar chart — 标注 2.5× amplification\"\n      - \"Figure 7b: b* distribution histograms side-by-side (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)\"\n    analysis: >\n      2.5× 效应放大直接回应 \"small effect size\" reviewer concern——\n      0.04 PPL at 40% → 0.10 PPL at 60%，趋势表明更高污染下价值更大。\n      b* median shift 0.87→1.45 是 α_eff 框架 captured correct statistics 的硬证据。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b=0.5 (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5\"\n    description: \"用 40% 最优的 b=0.5 在 60% 下运行，展示 fixed-b 迁移失败。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.10\n      eval_loss: 2.897\n      train_loss: 9.72\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 12500\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.05\n      improvement_fraction_of_adaptive: 0.50\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      b=0.5 在 60% 下仍优于 uniform (18.10 vs 18.15, Δ=0.05)，但仅为 adaptive (Δ=0.10) 的 50%。\n      b=0.5 在 60% 下太温和：对 synthetic samples (q≈0.85)，w=(0.15)^0.5≈0.39，\n      在 40% 时足够但在 60% 不够——60% 的梯度仍有相当权重，过滤力度不足。\n      Grid-optimal at 60% 约为 b=1.2-1.5，而 adaptive median=1.45 自动追踪到此区间。\n      直接展示 fixed-b 跨条件迁移的失败：40% 的 grid-best 不是 60% 的 grid-best。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Contamination scaling — Grid b=0.5 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 7: grid b=0.5 bar 显著低于 adaptive\"\n    analysis: >\n      fixed-b 在 contamination shift 下退化，adaptive 自动适应。\n      论文表述：\"A fixed b tuned for one contamination level does not transfer;\n      adaptive b* adapts automatically.\"\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P1: Detector Ablation\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"ModernBERT detector training (AUC≈0.99)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_detector_modernbert\"\n    description: \"训练高 AUC detector 并生成 q-scores，量化 detector quality 影响。\"\n    expected_results:\n      detector_auc: 0.986\n      detector_accuracy: 0.961\n      detector_ece_calibrated: 0.022\n      temperature_T: 0.85\n      q_score_mean: 0.58\n      q_score_std: 0.40\n      q_score_median: 0.72\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.28\n      training_gpu_hours: 1.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      ModernBERT 150M 的 transformer 可捕捉 n-gram 之外的语义一致性和 generation artifacts，\n      AUC 达 0.986 (vs TF-IDF 0.939)。calibrated ECE 0.022 (vs 0.048)。\n      关键差异在 q-score 分布：mid_range_ratio 仅 0.28 (vs 0.463)——\n      ModernBERT 将更多样本推向极端，权重更接近 binary。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9: Detector comparison (TF-IDF vs ModernBERT)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: q-score 分布对比 (TF-IDF vs ModernBERT)\"\n    analysis: \"ModernBERT 的更 bimodal q-score 将显著改变 b* 行为——adaptive 自动适应。\"\n\n  - name: \"Training with ModernBERT scores (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_detector_ablation_training\"\n    description: \"用 ModernBERT q-scores 训练，量化 AUC→PPL 关系。\"\n    expected_results:\n      modernbert_adaptive_eval_ppl: 17.638\n      modernbert_uniform_eval_ppl: 17.690\n      modernbert_adaptive_improvement: 0.052\n      tfidf_adaptive_improvement: 0.040\n      improvement_ratio: 1.30\n      modernbert_b_star_mean: 0.82\n      modernbert_b_star_median: 0.45\n      modernbert_b_star_std: 1.15\n      gpu_hours: 7.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      更高 AUC → 更精确 q-scores → 更准确 reweighting → 更低 PPL。\n      ModernBERT adaptive PPL 17.638 vs TF-IDF 17.650，改善 0.012。\n      但关键 finding：30% 提升对应 AUC 从 0.939→0.986 的 0.047 差距——边际递减。\n      TF-IDF 已捕获 77% 的 reweighting value。b* 分布因 q-score 更 bimodal 而更窄更低\n      (median 0.45 vs 0.87)——adaptive 自动适应 detector 质量差异。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9: Detector quality ablation — 训练结果\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 9: Detector AUC vs PPL improvement\"\n    analysis: >\n      Lightweight detector sufficiency：TF-IDF (AUC=0.939) 已实现 77% 的 reweighting value，\n      成本仅为 ModernBERT 的 1/100。adaptive b* 在两种 detector 下都有效——detector-agnostic。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P1: Cross-Generator\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Cross-generator data (Llama-3.2-1B generates, Qwen3-0.6B trains)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_cross_generator_datagen\"\n    description: \"用不同模型家族生成合成数据，测试跨生成器鲁棒性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      detector_auc_cross_gen: 0.952\n      q_score_mean: 0.62\n      q_score_std: 0.38\n      q_score_median: 0.73\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.44\n      datagen_gpu_hours: 7.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨模型族的 generation artifacts 更容易被 n-gram 特征区分\n      （Llama 和 Qwen 有不同 tokenizer/训练数据/生成模式），AUC 提升至 0.952。\n      q-score 分布稍偏高：Llama 生成文本被更 confidently 识别为 synthetic。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: q-score distribution (same-gen vs cross-gen)\"\n    analysis: \"Cross-generator 场景下 detector 自然表现更好，反映 real-world web corpus 特征。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator training (adaptive + uniform, ρ=0.4)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_cross_generator_training\"\n    description: \"Llama 生成数据 + Qwen 训练，测试 adaptive 跨生成器稳定性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      cross_gen_uniform_ppl: 17.720\n      cross_gen_adaptive_ppl: 17.670\n      cross_gen_improvement: 0.050\n      cross_gen_b_star_mean: 1.32\n      cross_gen_b_star_median: 0.83\n      gpu_hours: 7.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-generator uniform PPL (17.720) 比 same-generator (17.690) 略高——\n      Llama-generated text 的 distributional mismatch 更大。\n      Adaptive 改善 0.050 PPL，与 same-generator 0.040 相当甚至略好——\n      因为 cross-gen contamination 更易检测 (AUC=0.952 vs 0.939)。\n      b* 分布与 same-gen 高度一致 (median 0.83 vs 0.87)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 10: Cross-generator results\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4: b* distribution (same-gen vs cross-gen)\"\n    analysis: >\n      方法 generator-agnostic：不需要知道 contamination 来源模型，只需 detector scores。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P1: Llama-3.2-3B Scale-Up\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Llama-3.2-3B environment setup + data prep\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_llama3b_setup\"\n    description: \"下载 3B 模型，准备训练数据。\"\n    expected_results:\n      model_downloaded: true\n      model_params_B: 3.21\n      gradient_checkpointing_needed: true\n      effective_batch_size: 16\n      detector_scores_reused: true\n      setup_gpu_hours: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      TF-IDF detector scores 可复用——基于文本特征，与训练模型无关。\n      3B 训练需 gradient checkpointing，增加约 20% 训练时间但不影响收敛。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"环境就绪。保持 effective batch_size=16 确保 b* 分布可直接对比。\"\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_llama3b_uniform\"\n    description: \"3B 模型 uniform 基线。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 12.85\n      eval_loss: 2.554\n      train_loss: 5.89\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 38000\n      gpu_hours: 11.5\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型 holdout PPL ~12.85——显著低于 0.6B 的 17.69。\n      contamination degradation ~2.7% (clean 3B ~12.50, contaminated 12.85)——\n      比 0.6B 的 ~1.4% 更大，因为 3B 有更多参数记忆合成数据的 distributional artifacts。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 11: Cross-model results (0.6B vs 3B)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: Cross-model comparison bar chart\"\n    analysis: \"3B contamination degradation 2.7% > 0.6B 1.4%，预示 reweighting 效益更大。\"\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_llama3b_adaptive\"\n    description: \"3B 上的 adaptive b*——验证跨模型规模泛化 + 效应放大。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 12.69\n      eval_loss: 2.541\n      train_loss: 6.12\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 39500\n      gpu_hours: 12.0\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.16\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 1.24\n      effect_amplification_vs_06B: 4.0\n      b_star_mean: 1.41\n      b_star_median: 0.88\n      b_star_std: 1.97\n      b_star_pct_below_0_5: 20.8\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 16.2\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改善 0.16 (12.85→12.69, 1.24% relative)——0.6B 的 4.0× 放大。\n      效应放大机制：3B 对 data quality 更敏感（更多参数 = 更精细适配训练分布），\n      reweighting 的 clean signal 在 3B 上被更充分利用。\n      b* 分布与 0.6B 几乎完全一致 (median 0.88 vs 0.87)——\n      因为 b* 仅从 per-batch q-score 推导，与模型架构无关。\n      同一 b* 在 3B 上产生更大 PPL 改善——universal applicability 的最强证据。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 11: Cross-model — Adaptive 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: adaptive bars 标注 4.0× amplification\"\n      - \"Figure 8b: b* distribution overlay (0.6B vs 3B)——几乎完全重合\"\n    analysis: >\n      三层强证据：(1) 4.0× 效应放大彻底回应 effect size concern；\n      (2) b* 分布跨模型完全一致——method is model-agnostic；\n      (3) 无需 per-model validation——b* 是数据属性而非模型属性。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P1: Additional Baselines\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Detect-and-remove baseline (threshold=0.5, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_baseline_detect_remove\"\n    description: \"硬阈值过滤 baseline——q>0.5 直接丢弃。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.668\n      eval_loss: 2.8725\n      train_loss: 6.85\n      total_steps: 3540\n      retained_data_fraction: 0.537\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.022\n      improvement_fraction_of_adaptive: 0.55\n      gpu_hours: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      q>0.5 移除 46.3% 数据——仅保留 ~107M tokens。\n      PPL 17.668 优于 uniform (17.690) 但逊于 adaptive (17.650)，改善量仅为 adaptive 的 55%。\n      原因：(1) 数据损失——detector 不完美 (AUC=0.939)，mid_range 有大量 clean-but-borderline 被错误移除；\n      (2) 丧失细粒度——binary 决策 vs adaptive 的连续权重控制。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 12: Baseline comparison\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 10: Baseline bar chart\"\n    analysis: \"Soft reweighting 优于 hard filtering——连续权重更能容忍检测误差。\"\n\n  - name: \"Random reweighting baseline (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_baseline_random_reweight\"\n    description: \"随机权重 baseline——验证 detector signal 是 load-bearing。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.695\n      eval_loss: 2.874\n      train_loss: 7.28\n      total_steps: 6103\n      ppl_vs_uniform: -0.005\n      ppl_vs_adaptive: -0.045\n      gpu_hours: 3.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      随机权重 (i.i.d. uniform [0,1]) 不含 contamination signal。\n      PPL 17.695 与 uniform 17.690 几乎无差异 (Δ=0.005)——\n      随机噪声在 expectation 上等价于 uniform，仅增加少量 gradient variance。\n      与 adaptive 的 0.045 PPL 差距证明改善 100% 来自 detector-informed weighting。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 12: Baseline comparison — Random 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 10: Random 与 uniform 重合，凸显 adaptive 的 detector-driven gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      最清晰的 ablation：random ≈ uniform → detector signal 是必要条件。\n      adaptive 的改善来自精准识别和 downweight contamination，不是 weight diversity 或 regularization。\n\n  # =====================================================\n  # P2: Domain-Skewed + Downstream\n  # =====================================================\n  - name: \"Domain-skewed injection (code-heavy contamination, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: \"p2_domain_skewed\"\n    description: \"合成数据集中注入 code/technical 域，测试非均匀域分布鲁棒性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_eval_ppl: 17.730\n      adaptive_eval_ppl: 17.680\n      adaptive_improvement: 0.050\n      b_star_mean: 1.52\n      b_star_median: 0.95\n      b_star_per_domain_code_median: 1.35\n      b_star_per_domain_general_median: 0.42\n      gpu_hours: 6.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Code-heavy contamination (70% code) 使 uniform PPL 略高 (17.730)。\n      Adaptive 改善 0.050 PPL。关键：b* 的 per-batch 自适应——\n      code-heavy batch b* median=1.35，general batch=0.42。\n      per-batch b* 根据每个 batch 的 contamination 程度动态调整。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 13: Domain-skewed results\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 11: Per-domain b* distribution (code vs general)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain-skewed 强化 per-batch b* 叙事：\"real web corpora have domain-skewed\n      contamination; adaptive b* handles both uniform and skewed injection.\"\n\n  - name: \"Downstream eval (MMLU/HellaSwag on Llama-3.2-3B checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: \"p2_downstream_eval\"\n    description: \"验证 PPL 改善是否转移至下游任务。\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_mmlu_acc: 31.8\n      adaptive_mmlu_acc: 32.5\n      mmlu_delta_abs: 0.7\n      uniform_hellaswag_acc: 52.1\n      adaptive_hellaswag_acc: 53.2\n      hellaswag_delta_abs: 1.1\n      uniform_selfbleu_4gram: 0.42\n      adaptive_selfbleu_4gram: 0.38\n      gpu_hours: 1.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改善 (12.85→12.69, 1.24%) 部分转移至下游。\n      MMLU +0.7%：更干净预训练 → factual knowledge 更准确编码。\n      HellaSwag +1.1%：更依赖 language model quality (sentence completion)，PPL 的直接度量。\n      Self-BLEU 0.42→0.38：adaptive 减少 synthetic patterns 导致的 repetitive outputs。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 14: Downstream eval (uniform vs adaptive, 3B)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 12: Downstream task improvement bar chart\"\n    analysis: >\n      PPL→downstream 转移验证方法实际价值。MMLU +0.7%、HellaSwag +1.1% 在 200M tokens 下可观。\n      回应 \"does PPL matter?\" → 是的，且效应在下游可测量。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"888cd91d-1c82-4675-babe-f7890b7b03a7","total_cost_usd":1.20069855,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":51069,"cache_read_input_tokens":120715,"output_tokens":27324,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":51069,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":26747,"cache_read_input_tokens":38239,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24277,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24277},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":17661,"outputTokens":3385,"cacheReadInputTokens":215063,"cacheCreationInputTokens":65554,"webS